## 📌 Overview

A professional AI-powered employee onboarding management system with orchestrator agent coordination and real-time progress tracking.


---

## 📌 Overview

A professional AI-powered employee onboarding management system with orchestrator agent coordination and real-time progress tracking.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🧠 **Orchestrator Agent** – Rule-based workflow coordinator with 8 sequential tasks.
- 📊 **Real-time Tracking** – Live dashboard updates (2–5 sec auto-refresh).
- 👥 **Dual Roles** – Separate HR and Manager interfaces.
- 🔁 **Retry Management** – Managers can retry failed tasks (max 3 attempts).
- 📝 **Full Logging** – All actions tracked with history.
- 🎨 **Enterprise UI** – Professional blue theme.
- 🔐 **JWT Authentication** – Secure token-based access.
- 💾 **SQLite DB** – Lightweight persistent storage.

---

## 🔄 Workflow Flows

### 1. Onboarding Sequence Flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[HR Login] --> B[Create Employee]
    B --> C[Trigger Orchestrator]
    C --> T1[Task 1: Account Creation]
    T1 --> T2[Task 2: IT Asset Setup]
    T2 --> T3[Task 3: HR Document Signing]
    T3 --> T4[Task 4: Manager Introduction]
    T4 --> T5[Task 5: Workspace Assignment]
    T5 --> T6[Task 6: Training Enrollment]
    T6 --> T7[Task 7: Policy Acknowledgment]
    T7 --> T8[Task 8: Welcome Kit Dispatch]
    T8 --> Z[✅ Onboarding Complete]

```
### 2. Task Execution & Retry Flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Task Start] --> B[In Progress]
    B --> C{Success?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Next Task]
    C -- No --> E[Mark Failed]
    E --> F[Notify Manager]
    F --> G[Manager Clicks Retry]
    G --> H[Reset to Pending]
    H --> B

```
### 3. User Role Flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Login] --> B{Role Check}
    B -- HR Role --> C[HR Capabilities]
    B -- Manager Role --> D[Manager Capabilities]
    
    C --> C1[• Create Employee]
    C --> C2[• View All Tasks]
    C --> C3[• Full Log Access]
    C --> C4[• Delete Employee]
    
    D --> D1[• View Team]
    D --> D2[• Monitor Tasks]
    D --> D3[• Retry Failed Tasks]
    D --> D4[• View Task Details]

```
## 💾 Database Schema (4 Tables)
| Table | Key Fields |
|---|---|
| **Users** | id, username, password, role, created_at |
| **Employees** | id, user_id (FK), name, email, department, status, created_at |
| **Tasks** | id, employee_id (FK), task_name, status, retry_count, executed_at, error_msg |
| **Logs** | id, employee_id (FK), action, timestamp, user_role |
## 📋 Onboarding Tasks (8 Steps)
 1. **Account Creation** – Create user accounts (HR)
 2. **IT Asset Setup** – Configure laptop/software (IT)
 3. **HR Document Signing** – Complete contracts (HR)
 4. **Manager Introduction** – Meet team lead (Manager)
 5. **Workspace Assignment** – Assign desk/access (Facilities)
 6. **Training Enrollment** – Register for courses (HR)
 7. **Policy Acknowledgment** – Sign policies (HR)
 8. **Welcome Kit Dispatch** – Send swag bag (HR)
> 💡 **Status Flow:** Pending → In Progress → Completed
> ⚠️ **Failure Flow:** Failed → Retry (max 3) → Pending → In Progress → Completed
> 
## 🛠️ Tech Stack
### Backend
 * **Python 3.9+**
 * **FastAPI**
 * **SQLite**
 * **JWT**
 * **Uvicorn**
### Frontend
 * **HTML5 / CSS3**
 * **JavaScript (ES6+)**
 * **Fetch API**
 * **setInterval** (2–5 sec polling)
## 🚀 Installation (Step-by-Step)
### Standard Installation
```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/shansree-z/Orbit_V4.git](https://github.com/shansree-z/Orbit_V4.git)
cd Orbit_V4

# Create and activate virtual environment
python -m venv venv
# On Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate      
# On Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate   

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Initialize database and run the app
python init_db.py
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

```
### Docker Alternative
```bash
docker build -t orbit-v4 .
docker run -p 8000:8000 orbit-v4

```
## 📖 Usage
### Access URLs
 * **HR Dashboard:** http://localhost:8000
 * **Manager Dashboard:** http://localhost:8000/manager
 * **API Documentation:** http://localhost:8000/docs
### Default Credentials
| Role | Username | Password |
|---|---|---|
| **HR** | hr@orbit.com | hr123 |
| **Manager** | manager@orbit.com | mgr123 |
### Quick Start Steps
 1. Login with your respective role credentials.
 2. **HR** creates a new employee profile.
 3. The **Orchestrator** runs the 8 tasks sequentially automatically.
 4. Monitor real-time progress via the live dashboard.
 5. **Managers** can intervene and retry failed tasks if any occur.
 6. System marks onboarding complete when all 8 tasks clear! ✅
