## 🔐 API Endpoints
| Method | Endpoint | Auth Required | Role Allowed |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/login | None | Anyone |
| POST | /api/employees | JWT | HR only |
| GET | /api/employees | JWT | HR / Manager |
| GET | /api/employees/{id}/tasks | JWT | HR / Manager |
| POST | /api/tasks/{id}/retry | JWT | Manager only |
| GET | /api/logs | JWT | HR only |
## 📊 Logging System
### Captured Actions
 * Task initiation / completion / failure states.
 * Task retry actions.
 * Employee profile creations.
 * Workflow status changes.
 * User authentication logins.
### Log Format
```text
ID | Employee | Action | Timestamp | User Role

```
